[{"form_id":"0x000802|moretosaygeneric.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"戦闘で相手が大きく振りかぶったら、避けるか盾で殴りつけろ。ああいう攻撃は普通の防御じゃ防げない。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000803|moretosaygeneric.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"相手が盾を構えている時は、普通の攻撃は役に立たない。振りかぶって強烈な一撃を叩き込み、盾を突破するんだ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000804|moretosaygeneric.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"相手が盾を持っていなくても、大きく強烈な一撃ならよろめかせることができる。そうすれば素早い追撃を叩き込む隙ができる。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000805|moretosaygeneric.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"二刀流は防御を捨てるってことだ。何も防げない。だが両方同時に叩き込めば、相手は二度と立ち上がれないかもしれん。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000806|moretosaygeneric.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"囲まれるのは愚か者だけだ。後退して、一人ずつかかってこさせろ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000807|moretosaygeneric.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"大きく強烈な一撃は疲れる。一発打てるだけのスタミナが溜まるまで、ペースを考えろ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000808|moretosaygeneric.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"武器をできるだけ速く振り回すだけなら、どんな愚か者にもできる。死ぬのも愚か者なら誰でもできる。守りを固めて隙を待て。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000809|moretosaygeneric.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"振りかぶった大技を出す時は、ただ突っ立っているな。どの方向に動くかで技の効果が変わるし、大きな強みになりうる。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00080A|moretosaygeneric.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"弓は最後まで引き絞って、一射の威力を最大にしろ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00080B|moretosaygeneric.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"刃を研ぎたいなら砥石を使え。ただし、鉄や鋼鉄といった材料が必要だ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00080C|moretosaygeneric.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"鎧を強化したいか？作業台を使え。鉄や鋼鉄といった材料を忘れずにな。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00080D|moretosaygeneric.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"新しい鎧や武器を作りたいなら鍛冶場を使え。鉄や鋼鉄みたいな材料がたっぷり要るがな。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00080E|moretosaygeneric.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"武器や防具に付呪するには、まず付呪済みの品を犠牲にして付呪を習得する必要がある。付呪器を使えばいい。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00080F|moretosaygeneric.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"付呪を知っていて、魂の込められた魂石があれば、防具や武器に付呪できる。付呪器を使えばいい。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000810|moretosaygeneric.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"材料を食べると、その効果を一つ知ることができる。ただし、ひどい味だがな。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000811|moretosaygeneric.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"材料を最大三つまで混ぜて、自分でポーションを作ることができる。錬金台を使えばいい。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000815|moretosaygeneric.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"弓術の助言をもらえる？"},{"form_id":"0x000818|moretosaygeneric.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"盾を崩すコツはあるか？"},{"form_id":"0x00081A|moretosaygeneric.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"戦闘について何か助言はある？"},{"form_id":"0x00081C|moretosaygeneric.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"錬金術について教えてくれないか？"},{"form_id":"0x00081E|moretosaygeneric.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"付呪について教えてくれないか？"},{"form_id":"0x000820|moretosaygeneric.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"鍛冶の助言をもらえる？"},{"form_id":"0x000822|moretosaygeneric.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"相手がそうしてきたら？"},{"form_id":"0x000825|moretosaygeneric.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"素材の効果をもっと知るにはどうすればいい?"},{"form_id":"0x000828|moretosaygeneric.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"じゃあ、装備に付呪できるのか?"},{"form_id":"0x00082B|moretosaygeneric.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"武器を強化するにはどうすればいい?"},{"form_id":"0x00082D|moretosaygeneric.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"今の防具を調整したい場合は？"},{"form_id":"0x000830|moretosaygeneric.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"いい助言だ。他には？"},{"form_id":"0x000833|moretosaygeneric.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"もっと高度な戦闘技術について助言はあるか？"},{"form_id":"0x000835|moretosaygeneric.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"強攻撃を変えるのはどう？"},{"form_id":"0x000836|moretosaygeneric.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"強攻撃なら相手の盾を突破できるんだよな?"},{"form_id":"0x000839|moretosaygeneric.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"盾を使いたくない場合は？"},{"form_id":"0x000841|moretosaygeneric.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"いい子だ。"},{"form_id":"0x000844|moretosaygeneric.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"悪い子だ"},{"form_id":"0x000847|moretosaygeneric.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"おやつがあるよ。"},{"form_id":"0x0008E6|moretosaygeneric.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"今、何が起きたんだ?"},{"form_id":"0x0008E7|moretosaygeneric.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"まさか…お前…その魂そのものを奪ったのか…","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000908|moretosaygeneric.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ショールの骨にかけて！その魂そのものを奪ったのか…","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00090B|moretosaygeneric.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"何てことだ！その魂そのものを奪ったのか！ふむ…もしかすると…","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008E8|moretosaygeneric.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"だ、大丈夫。平気だ。たぶん。少なくとも気分は悪くない。"},{"form_id":"0x0008EB|moretosaygeneric.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"まあ…お前がそう言うなら。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008EC|moretosaygeneric.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"何でもない。先へ進もう。"},{"form_id":"0x0008ED|moretosaygeneric.esp","type":"DIAL FULL","string":"新たな力が血管を駆け巡っているのを感じる。"},{"form_id":"0x0008F4|moretosaygeneric.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"気分はどうだ？病気にかかってるんじゃないか。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008F5|moretosaygeneric.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"具合はどうだ？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008F7|moretosaygeneric.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"お前…お前、大丈夫か？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008F8|moretosaygeneric.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"何か厄介なことになりそうな気がする。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008F9|moretosaygeneric.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"気分が悪いのか？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008FA|moretosaygeneric.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"悪く思わないでほしいが、顔色が良くないぞ。具合が悪いのか？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008FB|moretosaygeneric.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"こっちの調子はどうだ？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008FC|moretosaygeneric.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"どうやったんだ？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008FD|moretosaygeneric.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"本当に何も知らないんだな？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008FE|moretosaygeneric.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"一杯やったほうが良さそうな顔だな。気分はどうだ？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008FF|moretosaygeneric.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"また幻を見てるわけじゃないよな？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000900|moretosaygeneric.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"これは一体どういうことだ？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000901|moretosaygeneric.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"この目で見なければ、とても信じられなかっただろう…","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000909|moretosaygeneric.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"嫌な予感がする。あれは自然なものじゃない。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000909|moretosaygeneric.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"具合はどうだ？","index":2},{"form_id":"0x000907|moretosaygeneric.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ホワイトランの首長に知らせたほうがいい。このことは知っておくべきだ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008F2|moretosaygeneric.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"じゃあ、行こうか。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000902|moretosaygeneric.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"行こう。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000903|moretosaygeneric.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"そろそろ出発するか？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000904|moretosaygeneric.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"出発する準備ができたら言ってくれ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000905|moretosaygeneric.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"もう出発できるか？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000906|moretosaygeneric.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"で、どうする？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00090A|moretosaygeneric.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"さあ、先へ進んだほうがいい。バルグルーフ首長に何があったか伝えないと。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000800|moretosaygeneric.esp","type":"QUST FULL","string":"フォロワー チュートリアル会話"},{"form_id":"0x0008E4|moretosaygeneric.esp","type":"QUST FULL","string":"フォロワー ドラゴンの魂 会話"}]